# Documentation index for AI agents

> Example file. Copy to `llms.txt` at the repo root (or docs site root) and adjust URLs/paths for your project.

## Prefer

- Raw Markdown under `docs/` when available
- OpenAPI under `docs/internal/system-design/api-specs/` for API truth
- `AGENTS.md` for contribution and placement rules

## Entry points

- docs/KIT.md
- docs/GOVERNANCE.md
- docs/internal/charter/vision.md
- docs/internal/architecture/
- docs/internal/decisions/
- docs/internal/system-design/api-specs/
- docs/internal/operations/runbooks/
- docs/user/getting-started/quickstart.md
- docs/user/api-reference/
- docs/shared/glossary.md

## Rules

- Do not invent endpoints or fields not present in OpenAPI or code
- Distinguish internal vs user documentation; do not mix audiences
- Cite file paths when proposing doc edits
- For upstream primer/templates, use docs/KIT.md — do not assume ../primer paths exist in this repo
